ad spoken vocal enters with the opening dialogue, supported by minimal percussive clicks.\nVerse: Full drum groove drops with crisp snare, steady hi-hats and a deep sub-bass line. Lead rap vocal carries the narrative dialogue; electric piano continues as the harmonic backbone, occasional percussive fills accent key punchlines. Dynamics stay restrained to foreground the storytelling.\nVerse: Beat remains consistent with subtle added shaker layers. Rap delivery grows more assertive, matching the escalating tension of the dialogue. Subtle bass note variations underline dramatic beats.\nVerse: Groove continues unchanged, rap cadence tightens further as the argument intensifies. Sparse snare rolls build subtle forward momentum toward the pre-chorus.\nPre-Chorus: Drum pattern intensifies with added snare rolls and elevated bass energy. Vocal delivery becomes more forceful and punchy, rising steadily in intensity. Filtered synth swells build tension leading directly into the chorus.\nChorus: Arrangement thickens fully. Layered vocal chants carry the anthemic hook, a warm synth pad fills the mid-range, the bass line becomes more melodic and pronounced. Call-and-response vocal layers create an immersive, crowd-like dramatic feel.\nVerse: Beat strips back slightly to center the rapid-fire rap verse. Tighter snare pattern, added percussive clicks, aggressive rap delivery with sharp cadence. Subtle bass stabs accent each lyrical punchline.\nChorus: Full arrangement returns with elevated energy. Additional ad-lib layers reinforce the hook, the drum pattern adds minor variations, overall intensity peaks here.\nOutro: Beat gradually decays, drum elements drop out one by one, electric piano chords slow and soften. Final vocal echoes dissolve into soft room ambience, fading out cleanly.", "[Intro]\n哥们\n这瓜多少钱一斤呐\n两块钱一斤\n我操\n这瓜皮子是金子做的还是瓜粒子是金子做的\n\n[Verse]\n你瞧瞧现在哪有瓜呀？这都是大棚里的瓜，你嫌贵我还嫌贵呢。\n给我挑个，给我挑一个行吗\n\n[Verse]\n这个怎么样\n这瓜保熟吗？\n我开水果摊的能卖给你生瓜蛋子？\n我问你这瓜保熟吗\n你是故意找茬是不是  你要不要吧\n\n[Verse]\n你这瓜要是熟的我肯定要啊，那他要是不熟怎么办呀\n要是不熟我自己吃了他满意了吧~~~\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n十五斤三十块\n你这哪够十五斤，你这秤有问题呀\n你他妈故意找茬是不是，你要不要吧\n吸铁石！呜呼~\n另外你说的这瓜要是生的你自己吞进去呀\n你他妈劈我瓜是吧\n\n[Chorus]\n萨日朗  萨日朗\n郝哥\n\n萨日朗  萨日朗\n华强\n诶~~\n华强~\n萨日朗  萨日朗\n萨日朗  萨日朗\n郝哥郝哥撑住呀\n\n萨日朗  萨日朗\n华强，诶~\n华强早他妈跑远啦\n\n\n[Verse]\n你就说该不该捅吧\n买个瓜他把吸铁石 吸底下\n黑心的商贩还敢嚣张 叫骂\n不治你我刘华强让电瓶车骑着爬\n\n[Chorus]\n萨日朗  萨日朗\n郝哥\n萨日朗  萨日朗\n华强\n诶~\n华强\n萨日朗  萨日朗\n萨日朗  萨日朗\n郝哥郝哥撑住呀\n萨日朗  萨日朗\n华强  诶~\n华强早他妈跑远啦\n\n[Outro]", 53, "increment", 240.00000000000006, 1, 65], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 64, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "caption"}, "name": "caption", "label": "caption", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "caption"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 92, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_duration"}, "name": "max_duration", "label": "max_duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "max_duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_scale"}, "name": "cfg_scale", "label": "cfg_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}], "flags": {}, "type": "MiniMaxMusic3TextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [710, 1150], "pos": [0, 0], "id": 44, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.31.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"seed": true}, "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxMusic3TextEncode"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [{"name": "seed", "links": [92, 93], "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [69, "increment"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SeedNode", "mode": 